  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每局先选一名决定全局思路的英雄和两个限定牌池的阵营，再购买升级单位、锁牌并装配关键道具。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "At the start of every run, choose one Hero (with a passive power that shapes your whole plan) and two Clans (which decide what cards you’ll play). That’s your squad. Spend gold to buy and upgrade units, freeze must-haves, and slap on game-changing items.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3002240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用短局异步对战冲击月度重置的排位赛季，并在每日“山丘之王”中争夺单局最高声望。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Ranked is where it counts: win runs, rank up, climb the leaderboard, and chase that sweet Ultimate Slacker title which is reset each month with a fresh season! Or claim the crown in our daily King of the Hill mode by scoring the highest Reputation in a single run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3002240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把厕纸、慢炖锅等超市日用品变成战斗单位，并围绕它们组合出荒诞联动。",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Toilet paper. Slow cooker. You name it. If it’s on the shelf, it’s ready for battle. We turned everyday store products into EPIC UNITS ! And they’ve got some seriously crazy synergies .",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3002240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
